| b          | Go backward one span                                                     | fey_agenda_earlier            |
| /          | Open prompt that allows filtering by category, tags and title(vim regex) | fey_agenda_filter             |
| <TAB>      | Open in another window                                                   | fey_agenda_goto               |
| J          | Jump to specific date                                                    | fey_agenda_goto_date          |
| .          | Go to today's span                                                       | fey_agenda_goto_today         |
| f          | Go forward one span                                                      | fey_agenda_later              |
| vm         | Show month view                                                          | fey_agenda_month_view         |
| <prefix>o  | Follow the first link in the item under the cursor                       | fey_agenda_open_at_point      |
| K          | Preview agenda item in floating window                                   | fey_agenda_preview            |
| <prefix>,  | Set priority for current item                                            | fey_agenda_priority           |
| -          | Decrease priority for current item                                       | fey_agenda_priority_down      |
| +          | Increase priority for current item                                       | fey_agenda_priority_up        |
| q          | Close agenda                                                             | fey_agenda_quit               |
| r          | Rebuild the agenda from the index (asks again in a match or search view) | fey_agenda_redo               |
| <prefix>r  | Refile heading to specific destination                                   | fey_agenda_refile             |
| <prefix>is | Insert/Update scheduled date on current heading                          | fey_agenda_schedule           |
| <prefix>xe | Set effort estimate for item under cursor                                | fey_agenda_set_effort         |
| <prefix>t  | Change labels of current heading                                         | fey_agenda_set_labels         |
| g?         | Show this help                                                           | fey_agenda_show_help          |
| <CR>       | Open in current window                                                   | fey_agenda_switch_to          |
| t          | Change TODO state of an item                                             | fey_agenda_todo               |
| <prefix>A  | Toggle "ARCHIVE" tag on current heading                                  | fey_agenda_toggle_archive_tag |
| vw         | Show week view                                                           | fey_agenda_week_view          |
| vy         | Show year view                                                           | fey_agenda_year_view          |

In the capture window:

| keys      | does                                                          | name                  |
+===========+===============================================================+=======================+
| <C-c>     | Write to the destination of the template and close the window | fey_capture_finalize  |
| <prefix>k | Close without saving                                          | fey_capture_kill      |
| <prefix>r | Write to a destination you pick                               | fey_capture_refile    |
| g?        | Show this help                                                | fey_capture_show_help |

In the closing note window:

| keys      | does                           | name              |
+===========+================================+===================+
| <C-c>     | Save note and close the window | fey_note_finalize |
| <prefix>k | Close without saving           | fey_note_kill     |

Text objects:

| keys | does                                    | name                     |
+======+=========================================+==========================+
| ah   | Select around heading                   | around_heading           |
| OH   | Select around heading from root heading | around_heading_from_root |
| ar   | Select around subtree                   | around_subtree           |
| OR   | Select around subtree from root heading | around_subtree_from_root |
| ih   | Select inner heading                    | inner_heading            |
| Oh   | Select inner heading from root heading  | inner_heading_from_root  |
| ir   | Select inner subtree                    | inner_subtree            |
| Or   | Select inner subtree from root heading  | inner_subtree_from_root  |

-- end generated: mappings --


  III. Disclaimer

Use Fey.nvim at your own risk. While we aim to only push working features, we
are a small team and thus bugs may slip through. Therefore maintain a backup of
your notes either with version control or otherwise to ensure that no automatic
editing feature of Fey.nvim will arbitrarily erase any important data.

Think of Fey.nvim now as an experimental playground made to make the basics of
editing Fey files easier but not bulletproof.


  IV. On the use of AI

We fully intend to develop Fey.nvim slowly and with care, taking ownership of
all generated code through a review process when an idea has been explored with
an AI and the approach suitable for incorporation.

We see the benefits and drawbacks of using AI to assist with coding, such as
faster output or easier bug-fixing, but also a degradation of skills if too much
reliance is put on the tool. This project is made with a passion for
programming, markup, and computer science generally (grammars, compilers, and
parsing specifically), we are not looking to offload the joy of developing this
tool to another entity. However, when it comes to writing boilerplate code, or
workshopping an idea that we already have worked out ourselves we see a net
benefit of achieving our goal of completing this plugin sooner than later for
everyone to enjoy.

With that said, we hope you do enjoy what we have accomplished so far.

Thanks for Reading.

-  Aldo Zeroun




